**Scaled dot-product attention**: Attention(Q,K,V) = softmax(QKᵛ/√d_k)V. Queries match keys; the scores weight the values. **Multi-head** attention runs several of these in parallel subspaces and concatenates. Cost is **quadratic in sequence length** — the fundamental scaling pressure behind every efficiency variant. (Vaswani et al., 'Attention Is All You Need,' 2017.)

