A transformer block: multi-head attention + position-wise feed-forward network, each wrapped in a **residual connection** and **normalization** (LayerNorm; many modern models use RMSNorm). **Positional information** is injected — originally sinusoidal encodings, now typically **rotary embeddings (RoPE)**. Stack N blocks: that is the model.

