**Entanglement**: correlations between qubits stronger than any classical correlation (Bell's theorem, experimentally confirmed — Nobel Prize 2022: Aspect, Clauser, Zeilinger). The **gate model** applies unitary operations (Hadamard, CNOT, phase gates); measurement collapses to classical bits. Algorithms are interference choreography: amplify right answers, cancel wrong ones.

