Motor BCIs let paralyzed users move cursors and robotic arms by decoded intent; **speech neuroprostheses** reconstruct intended speech from motor cortex at improving rates (2021–2024 papers showed striking progress). What it is *not*: mind reading — decoding works on trained tasks with cooperating subjects and heavy ML; 'thought extraction' headlines outrun the science by miles.

