**Function calling / tool use**: the model emits structured calls (JSON schemas), the harness executes them and returns observations. This grounds models in live data and real actions — and creates the attack surface: **prompt injection** (malicious instructions in tool outputs) is the signature vulnerability of the agent era. Treat every tool output as untrusted data.

