**Chiplets**: compose big chips from small dies (better yields, mix-and-match process nodes) — AMD's bet, now industry standard. **3D stacking** (HBM memory stacks, hybrid bonding): bandwidth through the vertical dimension. **Advanced packaging** (CoWoS and successors) is now as strategic as lithography — the bottleneck for AI accelerators is packaging capacity, not just wafers.

